ion has no reviews.":[""],"You need to at least select 1 download":[""],"You can also skip this step, but you will need to add an API key later to keep the reviews updated.":["Vous pouvez \u00e9galement passer cette \u00e9tape, mais vous devrez ajouter une cl\u00e9 d\u2019API ult\u00e9rieurement pour maintenir la mise \u00e0 jour des avis."],"You have reached the maximum sources limit, Please enter a valid API key to retrieve new sources.":["Vous avez atteint la limite maximale de sources. Veuillez saisir une cl\u00e9 d\u2019API valide pour r\u00e9cup\u00e9rer de nouvelles sources."],"Are you using a local host? API keys may be required for all review retrieving.":["Utilisez-vous un h\u00e9bergeur local\u00a0? Des cl\u00e9s d\u2019API peuvent \u00eatre n\u00e9cessaires pour r\u00e9cup\u00e9rer tous les avis."],"Select Source Type":["S\u00e9lectionnez le type de source"],"Add Downloads":[""],"Add Source Details":["Ajouter les d\u00e9tails de la source"],"Your URL must contain \"\/themes\/\" or \"\/plugins\/\". Examples: <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/wordpress.org\/plugins\/instagram-feed\/<\/a>, <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/wordpress.org\/themes\/twentytwentythree\/<\/a>":["Votre URL doit contenir \u00ab\u00a0\/themes\/\u00a0\u00bb ou \u00ab\u00a0\/plugins\/\u00a0\u00bb. Exemples\u00a0: <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/wordpress.org\/plugins\/instagram-feed\/<\/a>, <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/wordpress.org\/themes\/twentytwentythree\/<\/a>"],"Enter an Airbnb listing URL or numeric ID. Example: <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/www.airbnb.com\/rooms\/12345678<\/a>":[""],"Enter a Booking.com hotel URL or numeric ID. Example: <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/www.booking.com\/hotel\/us\/hotel-name.html<\/a>":[""],"Enter an AliExpress product URL or numeric ID. Example: <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/www.aliexpress.com\/item\/1234567890123.html<\/a>":[""],"Enter the Trustpilot review page URL, not just the domain. Example: <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/www.trustpilot.com\/review\/www.example.com<\/a>":[""],"Enter a listing URL