o license needed. Enjoy! \ud83d\ude42 To unlock more features, consider ":["Vous utilisez la version Lite de l\u2019extension, aucune licence n\u2019est n\u00e9cessaire. Profitez-en\u00a0!\u00a0\ud83d\ude42 Pour d\u00e9bloquer plus de fonctionnalit\u00e9s, envisagez une "],"Upgrading to Pro":["mise \u00e0 niveau vers la version Pro"],"As a valued user of our Lite plugin, you receive 50% OFF - automatically applied at checkout!":["En tant qu\u2019utilisateurs\/utilisatrices de notre extension Lite, vous b\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d\u2019une r\u00e9duction de 50 % - appliqu\u00e9e automatiquement lors de la commande\u00a0!"],"Install Pro":["Installer Pro"],"Select collection to export":[""],"Collection JSON exported!":[""],"Save Changes":["Enregistrer les modifications"],"Plugin Installed":["Extension install\u00e9e"],"Unknown Error":["Erreur inconnue"],"Plugin Activated":["Extension activ\u00e9e"],"Plugin Deactivated":["Extension d\u00e9sactiv\u00e9e"],"About Us":["\u00c0 propos"],"SmashBalloon Team":["\u00c9quipe Smash Balloon"],"At Smash Balloon, we build software that helps you create beautiful responsive social media feeds for your website in minutes.":["Chez Smash Balloon, nous concevons des logiciels qui vous aident \u00e0 cr\u00e9er en quelques minutes de magnifiques flux de r\u00e9seaux sociaux responsive pour votre site."],"We're on a mission to make it super simple to add social media feeds in WordPress. No more complicated setup steps, ugly iframe widgets, or negative page speed scores.":["Notre mission\u00a0: simplifier l\u2019ajout de flux de r\u00e9seaux sociaux dans WordPress. Finis les \u00e9tapes de configuration compliqu\u00e9es, les widgets iframe laids ou encore les scores de vitesse de page n\u00e9gatifs."],"Our plugins aren't just easy to use, but completely customizable, reliable, and fast! Which is why over 1.6 million awesome users, just like you, choose to use them on their site.":["Non seulement nos extensions sont faciles \u00e0 utiliser, mais elles sont aussi personnalisables, fiables et rapides\u00a0! C\u2019est pourquoi plus de 1,6 million d\u2019utilisateurs\/utilisatrices comme vous les utilisent d\u00e9j\u00e0 sur leur site."],"Our Other Social Media Feed Plugins":["Nos autres extensions de flux de r\u00e9seaux sociaux"],"We're more than just a Reviews plugin! Check out our other plugins and add more content to your site.":["Nous sommes plus qu\u2019une simple extension d\u2019avis\u00a0! Consultez nos autres extensions et ajoutez plus de contenu \u00e0 votre site."],"Install":["Installer"],"Installed":["Install\u00e9e"],"Social Wall":["Mur social"],"Combine feeds from all of our plugins into a single wall":["Combinez les flux de toutes nos extensions sur un seul mur."],"Plugins we recommend":["Les extensions que nous recommandons"],"What are they used for?":[""],"Solving an issue in your plugin might sometime require testing API access but with your setup. We do not want to expose your API keys over support messages and hence we use a temporary login link system to securely access it.":[""],"What can a support executive access?":[""],"A support team member can only access Smash Balloon plugin to make API requests. They can NOT access any other plugins, create posts or in any way modify your WordPress website.":[""],"Can I disable or delete the temporary login link?":[""],"The login link is auto-destroyed in 14 days. You can also manually delete it any time you want.":[""],"Temporary Login Links":[""],"Dismiss":["Ignorer"],"Search Documentation":["Rechercher dans la documentation"],"Need more support? We're here to help.":["Vous avez besoin d\u2019aide\u00a0? Nous sommes disponibles\u00a0!"],"Submit a Support Ticket":["Envoyez un ticket de support"],"Get Help in the WordPress.org Forum":["Obtenez de l\u2019aide sur le forum WordPress.org"],"Our fast and friendly support team is always happy to help!":["Notre \u00e9quipe de support rapide et bienveillante est toujours heureuse de vous aider\u00a0!"],"